            {
              "text": "A follow-up rhythm that works"
            }
          ],
          "props": {
            "level": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "A proposal that is sent and forgotten is a proposal lost. Pick a rhythm and put it on the calendar the day you send."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Same day: confirm they received it and offer a 15-minute walk-through."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Three days later: ask whether the price or the scope is the sticking point."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "One week later: offer to adjust the scope. Do not cut the price first."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Two days before it expires: say the date and ask for a decision either way."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "The Expiring this week list shows every proposal that needs a nudge right now."
            }
